{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Inspect a project for deployment"},"description":"Reads a project folder on this machine (manifests, lockfiles, runtime pins, framework configs, Dockerfiles, CI workflows, migrations, source code) and returns a Deployment facts table, each fact marked verified (with the file it came from) or unknown. Also lists the deployable apps with build/start/migrate commands and the environment variable NAMES split into build-time and run-time. Never reads env values: real .env files are reported as present, never opened. Use it first, in phase 1 of setting up a Plesk deployment. Changes nothing.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"project_dir":{"description":"Absolute path of the project folder. Defaults to the open project in Claude Code.","maxLength":4096,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"inspect_project","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"apps":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"build":{"type":"string"},"frameworks":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"kind":{"type":"string"},"migrate":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"string"},"suggested_stack":{"enum":["node","next","static","laravel"],"type":"string"}},"required":["path","kind","frameworks"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"ci":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"callable":{"type":"boolean"},"file":{"type":"string"},"triggers":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}},"required":["file","triggers","callable"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"env_files_present":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"env_names":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"build_time":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"run_time":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"sources":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}},"required":["build_time","run_time","sources"],"type":"object"},"facts":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"evidence":{"type":"string"},"fact":{"type":"string"},"status":{"enum":["verified","unknown"],"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}},"required":["fact","value","status"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"files_scanned":{"type":"number"},"project_dir":{"type":"string"},"truncated":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["project_dir","files_scanned","truncated","facts","apps","env_names","env_files_present","ci"],"type":"object"},"title":"Inspect a project for deployment"}
